Function Coloring turns math graphs into a canvas you can paint.

Add curves, drag coefficients to reshape them in real time, and tap the regions formed by intersections to fill them with color. Save artworks to the in-app album and reopen them to keep editing.

• Add polynomials, lines, trig, circles, and more
• Drag coefficients and watch curves change live
• Paint regions formed by intersections
• Pinch to zoom, drag to pan
• Save, share, and re-edit in the album
• Stored on this device (no account)

Color your formulas and create one-of-a-kind graph art.
